it on his own incentive.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep, with the first option (the &quot;Damn the Litany!&quot;-one), you go down the path of &quot;I want to eat the horse monster.&quot;. And that's then when Clay attacks your character in Crinos Form and you get yelled at because according to Clay/Scarper you don't have the right to eat the horse monster and Clay starts eating the horse monster instead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-16T17:33:18-07:00","id":1535756,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1535340-w5-videogame-text-adventure-book-of-hungry-names-review-first-impressions?p=1535753#post1535753\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yep, with the first option (the &quot;Damn the Litany!&quot;-one), you go down the path of &quot;I want to eat the horse monster.&quot;. And that's then when Clay attacks your character in Crinos Form and you get yelled at because according to Clay/Scarper you don't have the right to eat the horse monster and Clay starts eating the horse monster instead.</div> </div> </div> </div>So the pc isn't rail-roldeded eating the horse. Like I assume from you're tone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25848-mrornx","name":"MrornX","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"418"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-16T18:21:22-07:00","id":1535757,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrornX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1535340-w5-videogame-text-adventure-book-of-hungry-names-review-first-impressions?p=1535756#post1535756\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So the pc isn't rail-roldeded eating the horse. Like I assume from you're tone.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, no. Although it isn't clear why it's there as an option in the first place. It's both baffling when it shows up as an option for your character and when Clay is so insistent that he gotta eat the horse monster.<br /> <br /> &quot;Who gets to eat the fallen foe?&quot; isn't really a point of tension I would associate with modern day Garou. Especially a Wyrm tainted one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-16T23:43:17-07:00","id":1535759,"title":"","content":"The pig thing is weird.......are they trying to make Skull Pigs by feeding fomori remains to pigs?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26564-badfurryfanfic","name":"BadFurryFanFic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-16T23:45:00-07:00","id":1535760,"title":"","content":"Also it states that this pack successfully stopped the pipeline with spirit and other allies......unless Black Tarn was WAY more coherent back then I don't see how the other two ever made allies with anyone....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26564-badfurryfanfic","name":"BadFurryFanFic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-17T15:43:31-07:00","id":1535804,"title":"","content":"You get the option to eat the horse's meat because it smells like it promises power. You can resist this pull. I suspect it's a way for the bane possessing the horses to corrupt its foes (the bane is named later in the game and is one of the big ones serving the main antagonist).<br /> <br /> Garou in the game usually don't eat their foes.<br /> <br /> EDIT: I really like the game so far (I'm not finished with my first playthrough, a Silver Fang Philodox).<br /> <br /> By the way, I recommend regularly copying the game's &quot;storePShungrynamesPSstate&quot; file as save states that you can return to. I use these saves to occasionally try out various options. It saved me from some headaches whenever I missed/misinterpreted something in the text (especially when tired) and chose an option that didn't represent what I intended.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":387,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/387-caldorian","user":"Caldorian","date":". 05-17-2024, 06:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/387-caldorian","name":"Caldorian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-17T23:03:51-07:00","id":1535844,"title":"","content":"So, apparently Cockroach got radiation poisoning and had to be put down.<br /> <br /> Which means Hungry Names is not a reboot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude1e","count":4},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-18T03:49:16-07:00","id":1535847,"title":"","content":"You're telling me one of the most powerful incarna died from <i>radiation poisoning</i>. That's inane.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4},{"type":"\ud83d\ude1e","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theony